# {{.ProjectName}}

Go API with Echo router and Layered Architecture.

## Requirements

- Go 1.22+

## Run

```bash
go mod tidy
go run ./cmd/api
```

## Structure

```
├── cmd/api/               # Entry point and dependency wiring
├── internal/
│   └── item/              # Item module (handler, service, repository)
└── pkg/
    ├── bootstrap/         # DB connection and logger
    └── meta/              # Pagination helper
```

## Endpoints

- `POST /items`       — Create an item
- `GET  /items/:id`  — Get item by ID
